All,

These are the Jaipur depot scanner rules on agency staff logins, personal
phones, a lost scanner, freezer use, printer pairing, the unreturned scanner
charge and login logs.

Agency staff logins: agency staff get a day login that stops working 8 hours
after first use.

Personal phones: a personal phone may run the scanning app once IT has
registered it.

Lost scanner: report a lost scanner within 4 hours. IT wipes it remotely after
48 hours.

Freezer use: use a scanner in the freezer for 30 minutes at most, then give it
15 minutes outside.

Printer pairing: any picker may re-pair a label printer to another scanner.

Unreturned scanner charge: a scanner not returned by a leaver is deducted at
Rs. 12,000.

Login logs: scanner login logs are kept for 6 months.

